        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Use Effect.map to produce the result instead of Effect.as. This rule requires a callback that states how the operation produces its final value. Use Effect.asVoid to discard the result. Preserve the earlier Effect steps and their execution order.",
